1
00:00:00,166 --> 00:00:02,113
Part 26, aakhri part.

2
00:00:02,113 --> 00:00:09,254
Ek baar mein dekhte hain ki Medoro Distribution kya deta hai, kiske liye hai,

3
00:00:09,254 --> 00:00:11,850
aur aage kaise shuru karein.

4
00:00:12,805 --> 00:00:18,078
Medoro Distribution pharma distributors, wholesalers, stockists,

5
00:00:18,078 --> 00:00:25,329
super stockists aur C and F agents ke liye bana hai, ek godown se lekar bees godown tak.

6
00:00:25,983 --> 00:00:32,191
Sales ki taraf: credit check aur batch-wise reservation ke saath orders,

7
00:00:32,191 --> 00:00:39,779
automatic schemes aur free goods, aur CGST, SGST ya IGST ke saath wholesale GST invoice.

8
00:00:40,460 --> 00:00:46,701
Godown ki taraf: batch, expiry aur rack ke saath stock, godown transfers,

9
00:00:46,701 --> 00:00:53,968
mobile picking aur packing, dispatch aur delivery, aur expiry claims ka poora hisaab.

10
00:00:54,627 --> 00:01:03,219
Paise ki taraf: office, field aur delivery par collections, FIFO ageing, credit control,

11
00:01:03,219 --> 00:01:11,615
double-entry books, supplier ledger, GSTR-1 aur GSTR-3B JSON, aur chaudah MIS reports.

12
00:01:12,284 --> 00:01:19,240
Aur team ki taraf: chemist ordering portal, salesman field app, roles aur permissions,

13
00:01:19,240 --> 00:01:25,792
two-step sign-in, audit trail, encrypted backup, aur English aur Hindi interface.

14
00:01:26,456 --> 00:01:33,753
Is tour mein humne har feature ko asli software par, fictional data ke saath chala kar dekha.

15
00:01:33,753 --> 00:01:40,815
Jo feature abhi uplabdh nahi hai, ya bahari credentials maangta hai, woh saaf bataya gaya,

16
00:01:40,815 --> 00:01:43,012
aur QA report mein darj hai.

17
00:01:43,690 --> 00:01:49,052
Shuru karne ke liye medoro dot in slash distribution par jaaiye.

18
00:01:49,052 --> 00:01:52,822
Start 7-day free trial dabaiye, bina card ke.

19
00:01:52,822 --> 00:01:57,932
Ya Book a distribution demo se WhatsApp par demo book kariye.

20
00:01:57,932 --> 00:01:58,854
Dhanyavaad!
